OL,3,GNEWSAOne-off two-week half term begins
OL,4,Aafter concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the first time more than 70 schools
OL,7,Fin Surrey are beginning a two-week
OL,8,Fautumn half term holiday before
OL,9,Freverting back to one week following
OL,10,Fconcerns from headteachers.
OL,12,FA decision to extend the break for a
OL,13,Fweek at community and voluntary
OL,14,Fcontrolled schools, which are run by
OL,15,FSurrey County Council (SCC), was
OL,16,Foriginally made in May 2025.
OL,18,FBut after headteachers raised concerns
OL,19,Fabout the impact, it will go back to
OL,20,Fbeing a one-week holiday in the 2027-28
OL,21,Facademic year.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
